      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, address",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>To my son who is dear to me, Ab\u016b l-Sur\u016br Fara\u1e25 ibn Ism\u0101\u02bf\u012bl ibn Fara\u1e25, may he rest in Eden,</li>\n<li>may God prolong his life and make his support, wellbeing, and happiness eternal.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;From&nbsp;Ism\u0101\u02bf\u012bl&nbsp;ibn&nbsp;Fara\u1e25,&nbsp;may he rest in Eden.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
